+- $\mathcal{E}_\lambda$：depolarizing channel
+- $W_F^B$：$B$-centered Werner state ($F$ weight to $|B\rangle\langle B|$, $(1-F)/3$ to 其他 Bell)
+- 默认 $W_F := W_F^{\Phi^+}$
+- $q$：effective MDI QBER (Z 或 X basis, 同值 per Werner 对称性)
 
